# Swift — Air Logistics / Transport Unit
# Role: High-speed air transport. Can pick up and carry size-1 units (like Runner).
# No weapons. Built for speed and payload delivery.

type: flying
name: Swift

description: "A fast sci-fi transport aircraft with swept-forward wings and cargo clamps. Capable of picking up and relocating ground units for rapid tactical redeployment."

health: 350
armor: 2
speed: 4.5
hitSize: 18
rotateSpeed: 6
itemCapacity: 80

# Payload — can carry size-1 units (Runner is ~8 hitSize, well within capacity)
payloadCapacity: 8

# Flying characteristics — fast, agile
flying: true
accel: 0.08
drag: 0.03

# Engine visuals — dual jet engines
engineOffset: 9
engineSize: 3.5

# Low altitude flight
lowAltitude: false

# No weapons — pure transport
weapons: []

# Research tree placement
research: air-factory
